SUMMARY:Monthly Cleanup
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nThe Saturday after the mon
 thly members meeting of each month is our Cleanup Day. It's a chance for o
 ur members to come together to help make Splat Space more organized. Wheth
 er it's sorting bolts\, vacuuming the carpets\, removing scrap or re-arran
 ging the space\, anything that helps to make the space more open and organ
 ized is appreciated.
