BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_316639130@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053307Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T160000
SUMMARY:Open House
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nEvery Saturday between 1pm
  to 4pm we open our doors to the public to give anyone who wants to stop b
 y a chance to see our space. It's a chance for prospective new members to 
 take a tour of our space and ask any questions they have about what we off
 er.\n\nFeel free to come by or contact us if you want to schedule a tour.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/316639130/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260920T173927Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260920T173927Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_316700110@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053307Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T200000
SUMMARY:Woodshop Wednesdays
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nHave a project you need he
 lp with? Want to learn how to safely use the wood shop equipment? Just wan
 t to hang out and talk shop? Come on by. Each week one or more of our more
  knowledgeable wood workers will be there to help. No need to sign up.\n\n
 We look forward to seeing you all there!\n\nThis is a members only event.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/316700110/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260924T215638Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924T215638Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
